  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the recent AVPro version update, BaseVRCVideoPlayer.IsPlaying goes true, but then false a few seconds after playback begins on MPEG-TS streams. This causes issues with a custom player I'm using that blanks the screen when IsPlaying is false. The stream otherwise plays okay, it's just that the value of IsPlaying is wrong.\n\nThis was tested with a VRCDN MPEG-TS stream, of the form `https://stream.vrcdn.live/live/EXAMPLE.live.ts`. I don't have a VRCDN account myself so I cannot provide any kind of persistent test stream.\n\nAs this is just an incorrect value returned by the video player API, there is no log output associated with this issue.",
